  "description": "29er/29+ Double Butted Cr-mo frame and fork designed for Bikepacking and singletrack.\n\nThis frame and fork is designed to be your go to ride for any off road adventure. This frame fits your regular 29er wheels for those gravel grinding and single track rides but will accommodate the widest 29+ (3\") tyres for those adventures that get a little further off the groomed trails.\n\nUnlike some other 29+ frames which get stretched out and ride a little slow, the Hunt Bikes frame/fork has been designed to ride more like a regular 29er. This was achieved in part by keeping the chainstays as short as possible with a custom chainstay piece between the chainrings and the tyre.\n\nThe frame and forks are built using double butted 4130 tubing to keep things light and maintain a responsive feel while also being a reliable tough frame/fork that can handle a bit of rough treatment.",
